  "title": "Vasia",
  "text": "Vasia is a comune (municipality) in the Province of Imperia in the Italian region Liguria, located about 100 kilometres (62 mi) southwest of Genoa and about 9 kilometres (6 mi) northwest of Imperia.\n\nVasia borders the following municipalities: Borgomaro, Dolcedo, Imperia, Lucinasco, Pontedassio, and Prelà.",
